From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fwlta <monkeyfwlta@protonmail.com>
Date: Tue, 16 Sep 2026 00:00:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] pinctrl: qcom: sm6225: drop missing remove callback

msm_pinctrl_remove does not exist in this tree, same as the other
sm6xxx pinctrl drivers which register no remove callback.

Signed-off-by: fwlta <monkeyfwlta@protonmail.com>
---
 drivers/pinctrl/qcom/pinctrl-sm6225.c | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/pinctrl/qcom/pinctrl-sm6225.c b/drivers/pinctrl/qcom/pinctrl-sm6225.c
--- a/drivers/pinctrl/qcom/pinctrl-sm6225.c
+++ b/drivers/pinctrl/qcom/pinctrl-sm6225.c
@@ -918,8 +918,7 @@
 		.of_match_table = sm6225_tlmm_of_match,
 	},
 	.probe = sm6225_tlmm_probe,
-	.remove = msm_pinctrl_remove,
 };
 
 static int __init sm6225_tlmm_init(void)
